86 0 obj
<< /BS << /W 0 >> /F 4 /FT /Btn /Ff 65536 /MK << /BC [ 0 0 0 0 ] >> /P 9 0 R /Rect [ 85.139999 126.723971 510.419983 435.843966 ] /Subtype /Widget /T (Figure2) /TU (Flowchart depicting the process of filtering publications for review. Initially, 1,748 publications were identified from Scopus \(271\), PubMed \(147\), Science Direct \(1,098\), and IEEE Xplorer \(232\). After screening, 156 publications remained; 1,592 were excluded due to reasons like duplicate publications and non-English language. Following methodological assessment, 61 publications were selected; 95 were excluded for insufficient data analysis and lack of clear findings. Twelve publications were added through snowball search and cross-referencing, resulting in a final review set of 73 publications.) /Type /Annot >>
endobj
